set the wallpaper directly instead of through a cropper

"Set as wallpaper" (PictureEditorDM.a(), log tag WallpaperSetUtil) asked
WallpaperManager.getCropAndSetWallpaperIntent() for a crop activity and started it. On
this ROM that throws "Cannot use passed URI to set wallpaper", because no activity in the
launcher package or in config_wallpaperCropperPackage handles CROP_AND_SET_WALLPAPER, so the
✓ button did nothing. The picked image is now read with ContentResolver.openInputStream()
and passed to WallpaperManager.setStream(stream, null, true, FLAG_SYSTEM | FLAG_LOCK),
followed by a "Wallpaper set" toast. There is no crop step; the wallpaper service scales the
image itself.

